      "widgets_values": [
        "# Open H3 Regenerate IC\n\n1. Install requirements and download IC Diffusers weights to models/open_h3_ic.\n2. Select a 4.7–5.2 second draft in LoadVideo (first 124 frames at 24 fps).\n3. Enter the original draft prompt in caption.\n4. Keep standard VAE for lower VRAM. Use IC Decode for this normalized latent.\n\nLow VRAM: lower token_chunk/head_chunk; online streams K/V. Disk offload needs substantial SSD space.\nUpscaler tiles can slightly change detail/normalization. Full trained-model inference has not been benchmarked."
      ]
